<title>USA: Tele Danmark says Nils Wilhjelm resigns.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark says Nils Wilhjelm resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele Danmark said today Nils Wilhjelm has resigned as deputy chairman of the non-executive board of directors.</p>
<p>The company said the position will be filled at the annual general meeting on April 28.</p>
<p>The company said Wilhjelm's resignation &quot;is motivated by the attention to other tasks.&quot;</p>
<p>Tele Danmark, privatized in April 1994, is a provider of telephone service.</p>
